---

<section class="section" id="approach">
	<div class="container">
		<div class="section-head section-head--center">
			<span class="eyebrow">02 — How a build goes</span>
			<h2 class="section-title">Three steps to a system that runs itself.</h2>
			<p class="section-sub">
				No mystery builds, no black boxes. You always know what is being built, what it does, and how it is proven.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="approach-grid">
			<div class="step">
				<span class="step-num">STEP / 01</span>
				<h3>Discover</h3>
				<p>
					We audit where your home and business tech stands today — hardware, software, gaps — against your goals.
				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="step">
				<span class="step-num">STEP / 02</span>
				<h3>Design &amp; Build</h3>
				<p>
					One architecture, one build. Hardware, software and integrations all drawn from the same plan.
				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="step">
				<span class="step-num">STEP / 03</span>
				<h3>Verify &amp; Secure</h3>
				<p>
					We test, document, scan and report. You get a working system — and proof it works.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>